Web parity verified:
  • Single elevation AREA over the DISTANCE x-axis (web XAxis dataKey="distance").
  • Dashed REFERENCE LINE at currentIndex's distance (web <ReferenceLine x=
    cursorDistance>); tap → nearest index → onClickIndex broadcast.
