  • Empty branch (data.length === 0) → "No elevation data available".
  • Tooltip: distance fmt(2) + unit over elevation fmt(0) m labelled "Elevation".
  • SI canonical (ADR-004): distance/speed at the SI floor (m, m/s), converted only
